OK nethackers, here's a simple trick for dealing with the Orcus.  It 
follows you up and down stairs.  So, when you first get to that level,
wait for it to be standing next to you, then go back up the stairs.
Next, move around until he's not standing next to you, and go back down
the stairs.  Orcus is now stuck upstairs and you can do the level in 
peace.

On your way back, you can do the reverse (although I actually left 
him partway up Vlad's tower, and never ran into him again).

